==Meteor Falls==
[[File:Meteor Falls 1F1R E.png|thumb|left|Meteor Falls, 1F (front)]]

Nestled in the mountains between Routes {{rtn|114|Hoenn}} and {{rtn|115|Hoenn}}, [[Meteor Falls]] is said to have been the site of a meteor shower in the distant past. The cavern's rushing rapids prevent novice Trainers from fully exploring the area, as doing so requires certain {{m|Surf|field}} {{m|Waterfall|moves}}.

