===1F===
Head west over the bridge to find two [[Team Magma]] Grunts who have just stolen a Meteorite from [[Professor Cozmo]]. Soon after they notice you, the leader of the opposing Team Aqua enters, flanked by two of his subordinates. The thieves don't seem to care, and flee with the Meteorite to [[Mt. Chimney]]. The team leader introduces himself as [[Archie]], and tells you that his group intends to thwart the villainous team's plans at any cost, as they have committed many destructive acts in their bid to enlarge the landmass. The three then leave to pursue the thieves to Mt. Chimney. To pursue them yourself, exit Meteor Falls either north to {{rt|114|Hoenn}} or south to {{rt|115|Hoenn}}.
{{-}}

