===It's All Downhill===
Jump the first two ledges and go west. Inspect the patch of [[volcanic ash|ash]]-covered grass to find a hidden [[Full Heal]]. Take the stairway southward and jump the next two ledges, stopping near a Team Magma Grunt. Turn east and take the stairway to reach a [[Burn Heal]] lying near a tree. Jump the ledge to the south, then head all the way to the west and jump another ledge. Check the corner here for a hidden [[Great Ball]], then continue south past Camper Ethan to reach the exit. This leads to the southwest part of {{rt|112|Hoenn}}, just outside [[Lavaridge Town]].
{{-}}

==Lavaridge Town==
[[File:Lavaridge Town E.png|thumb|left|Lavaridge Town]]

Nestled at the foot of [[Mt. Chimney]], [[Lavaridge Town]] is a welcome sight for travelers and tourists alike. It is well-known throughout [[Hoenn]] for its soothing hot springs, said to cure any ailment, and also features a specialty shop that sells bitter but beneficial [[Herbal medicine|herbs]] for Pokémon. The [[Lavaridge Gym]], fourth in the [[Hoenn League]], stands in the southwest part of town.

